{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>He related</b> — from the root of explaining to them, for he explained to the officials the matter of the money." "<b>concerning the Jews</b> — on account of the Jews." "<b>To destroy them.</b> The sense is to blot out their name."], :book :esther, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {0 "Resolved מגזרת as deriving from the root גזר in the sense of 'cutting/explaining'; the clause is elliptical and reads awkwardly in the original."}, :source-witnesses [["Kol Sason, Krotoschin, 1840" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001728315"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:29:57.369590465Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}